        "line": 85,
        "text": "theorem angular_factorization (d : TailData) (y η : ℝ) :\n    finalAngular d (y, η) = finalAngular d (y, 0) *\n      Real.exp (-shapeExponent d y * Real.log (1 + η ^ 2))"
